# Docs are read by many and reviewed by few. A tracked text file silently classified
# BINARY is undiffable, so no edit to it is ever reviewable. That happened to a skill
# read by 14 clones and nobody noticed for weeks. Start diffable.
*.md   text diff
*.py   text diff
*.toml text diff
# Preserve raw terminal recording bytes and timing while keeping text reviewable.
docs/demos/inbox-recovery/output.log whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
# Terminal recordings retain CRLF bytes for scriptreplay timing.
docs/demos/cycle-resume/output.log whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
# Keep raw inbox-read recording bytes replayable and text reviewable.
docs/demos/inbox-read/output.log whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
# Preserve the PTY recording; CRLF is its literal terminal output.
docs/demos/push-source-remedy/output.txt whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
